Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:29.97,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnHYXuanSong 65S\fad(1000,0)\bord1.2\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\pos(120,426)\fs25\fsp3}—关于地球的运动—
